WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.351
Man with gray hair, glasses, black shirt tends green plants inside illuminated growth chamber.

2
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:18.287
A man in blue gloves continues tending to plants inside the illuminated growth chamber beside equipment racks.

3
00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:27.986
Person in glasses, blue glove arranges leaves, wearing black tee in growth chamber.

4
00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:40.373
The man reaches both gloved hands into the chamber to arrange plants while standing beside the machinery.

5
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:50.739
Gloved man adjusts foliage on equipment, harvesting leafy plants inside chamber.

6
00:00:56.574 --> 00:00:59.945
A person photographs a red pepper labeled MISSE-8.

7
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:13.264
Two men pose with astronaut in black shirt, adjusting his cap while others smile.

8
00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:28.462
Two astronauts pose inside station module filled with equipment.

9
00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:38.087
Group passes small green plant in microgravity while one films the interaction.

10
00:01:41.321 --> 00:01:46.559
Astronauts reach toward center point in station module as camera records group.
